                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Oh....  My....  Goodness...!\n\nEvery time...  I read one of these by DZ Labs...  They somehow get worse and worse!!!\n\nI just need to know...  Do the writers actually think THIS is normal?  Not sure whether to feel pity or feel a slight twinge of fear right about now.\n\nSo uh...  It's October...  Let's get into this creepfest then.\n\nForeword: We learn next to nothing about any of these characters.  Absolutely ALL of them are empty shells of nothing.  And also...  This game shows horrendous \"knowledge\" of butlers, their duties and even famous people.  It's SOOOOO BAD!  It's not even funny anymore!!!\n\n[u]The MC:[/u] Is nothing.  Has nothing to offer either.  \"Huh?  Huh?  Huh?\"  \"Yeah...  Yeah...\"  Has no eyes and really loves to be sexually assaulted.  The correct choices on all of those is \"GIVE INTO HIM\".  <--  Please...  For the love of everything...!  STOP!!!\n\n[b]NEVER EVER...  TAKE ANY OF THESE LESSONS AND THINK THEY ARE CORRECT!!!!!!![/b]\n\nDespicable.\n\n[u]Characters/Love Interests:[/u]\n\n- [i]The Aunt:[/i] Completely okay with her niece being r*ped and doesn't bother telling her anything about the guys and how they *really* are.  Deplorable.  Guess it runs in the family.\n\n- [i]The two side butlers:[/i]  One doesn't uphold his dress code correctly and the other one doesn't act like a Supervisor.  They know all that goes on in the mansion/between characters and completely let the MC get hurt.  Sounds about right.\n\n- [i]Yonekura:[/i] A disgusting, serial sexual assaulter that is overly narcissistic, possessive, doesn't give a sheet about anything or anyone and the ONLY, YES ONLY reason he \"wants\" the MC?  Is because some other guy was into her and he needed someone else to \"toy with and assault\".  That's it.\n\n- [i]Kira:[/i] An unforgivable sexual assaulter as well, but with a flair of sadism.  He is also highly idiotic.  I will only give him credit though...  He is the LEAST worst of the bunch!!!  But that's nothing.\n\n- [i]Makoto:[/i]  Gee, I just played a game with someone named \"Makoto\" and he has makings of a serial killer.  This one as well.  This guy is worse than the others...  By A WHOLE LOT!  He is a tsundere that transformed into a yandere and then went off to be a serial killer in the future.\n\nHe has a possessive streak...  To a point of an \"IMPRISONMENT FETISH\".  I abhor that fetish and him so much...  I quit his Route.  Vile.  Atrocious.  SICK!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n\n[u]What this book teaches you:[/u]\n\n- Sexual assault / Imprisonment / Other forms of torture are A - OKAY!  ->  You are NOT to DEFEND yourself OR TELL SOMEONE!!!!!!!!  You are to JUST TAKE IT!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!  Morons.  Absolute morons.  NEVER.  EVER.\n\n- Men are just horrendous creatures with vile intentions.  I am sick and tired of this already!  YES, SURE, there ARE men like that, but this...........!  FAQ YOU!!!\n\n- A disappointment to butlers everywhere.  A butler is someone who is not only dressed impeccably, it's a person who provides outmost outstanding service to their Lord or Lady.  When you see a butler, you feel respect for their duty.\n\nThis book?  Nah!  Dress them all in costumes, loosen their ties and let them BEND EVERY RULE.  It was never about the LADY ordering the \"butler\", it was about the \"butlers\" taking advantage of the stupid piece of sheet bint that didn't even bother to stand up for herself, before shoving a foot up their despicable possessive asses!!!\n\n....................\n\nI am not going to go on.  I wasn't going to write nearly as much as this either, but thanks to the imprisonment fetish and the MC enjoying being forced into everything...  I am going to freaking say something!\n\nEven if this reaches absolutely no one.  I still stood up for something I believed in and wrote the words that resonated deep within me.\n\nAnd that's far more of a better lesson than this book will ever teach you.",
